          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa ni ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵagonjesye ayimwene wosope mcilambo ca kungapilo lyuŵa kwa Yolodani, kutyocela ku Baala Gadi m'Ciŵata ca Lebanoni mpaka ku Litumbi lya Halaki kum'mwela ciŵandika ni Edomu. Yoswa ŵacigaŵenye cele cilamboci mwa mitundu ni kucipeleka kwa jemanjajo kuŵa cawocawo mpaka kalakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele upandewu ŵawupwatikenye cilambo ca kwitumbi, mwiŵanda mwa matumbi mbali jakapila lyuŵa, Ciŵata ca Yolodani, ni mwiŵanda mwa matumbi mwakwe, kwakutuluka matumbi ca kungopoko lyuŵa, ni cilambo ca cipululu ca kum'mwela. Cele cilamboci ni cicaliji kumangwawo kwa Ahiti, Aamoli, Akenani, Apelesi, Ahifi, ni Ayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵagonjesye ayimwene ŵa misinda aji: Yeliko, Ai (ciŵandika ni Beteli), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yelusalemu, Hebuloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalamuti, Lakishi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egiloni, Gesele, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
